  "subject": "a husband married twenty-five years who finds in a shoebox the postcard he mailed her from army training in 1999, returned for a wrong house number, and hand-delivers it across the kitchen table; she reads it aloud and writes her reply on a fridge note",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien new-age piano pop, Yiruma-style spacious ballad. Felt-hammer grand piano playing flowing broken-chord arpeggios and a simple singing right-hand motif; bamboo dizi flute answering between lines; warm sustained pad swelling under the chorus; fretless bass holding long root notes; soft brushed shaker, no kick drum. Spacious airy hall reverb on the piano, intimate close-miked vocal. Warm male baritone lead, clearly sung melody, soft female harmony on the chorus. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 82 BPM, D major. Wistful, warm, tender married love. No drum kit, no electric guitar, no trap beat, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n鞋盒仔底 一張明信片\n九九年的郵戳 黃黃\n門牌寫毋著 一个字\n退倒轉來 囥二十五冬\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n成功嶺的日頭 曝甲我黑\n字寫甲歪歪 攏咧想你\n\n[Chorus]\n這張批 今仔日才到\n我行過灶跤 交予你\n你目鏡掛起來 咧笑\n講 你的字 猶原遮爾歪\n\n[Verse]\n彼時你蹛 公館的巷仔\n我寫成 隔壁的號碼\n我等無批 你等無人\n險險 咱就按呢錯過\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n放假彼工 我去揣你\n你問我 哪攏無寫\n\n[Chorus]\n這張批 今仔日才到\n桌頂的茶 猶燒燒\n你一字一字 唸出聲\n我面紅甲 像少年\n\n[Verse]\n你講 你欲回批\n寫佇冰箱 便條紙\n我有收著 我嘛想你\n今仔暗 換你洗碗\n\n[Bridge]\n二十五年 遲到的話\n你嘛 無嫌傷慢\n\n[Chorus]\n這張批 今仔日才到\n我行過灶跤 交予你\n你共伊 夾入相簿\n講 這張 上界媠\n\n[Outro]\n遲到的批 準時的你\n規世人 慢慢仔讀",
